id: GQL-004
title: Apollo CSRF prevention disabled
category: graphql
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .py .rb .go .java
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: csrfPrevention
patterns:
  - regex: csrfPrevention\s*:\s*false
    message: "Apollo CSRF prevention disabled — enables cross-site request forgery"
fix: Set csrfPrevention: true (default in Apollo Server 4+). CSRF protection prevents malicious sites from executing mutations on behalf of authenticated users.
